config BR2_PACKAGE_BATTERY_HWCD
	bool "battery_hwcd"
	help
	  Userspace battery indicator daemon for the epass DEBE hardware
	  cursor overlay.  Reads /sys/class/power_supply and drives the
	  /sys/kernel/battery_hwc/ overlay (independent of the DRM master):
	  hidden above 10% until a key is pressed, red 1Hz blink below 10%,
	  a charging bolt while plugged in.

	  Requires the sun4i backend HWC overlay kernel patch.
